31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I have information. Takumi is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Rin,,What?! No way! Takumi is just a kid like me!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"That's a very bold claim for the first day, Jonathan. Are you the Seer?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Oh dear, this is quite a shock. Are you sure, Jonathan?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,What?! You're lying! I'm not the werewolf! You're just trying to frame me!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I am the Seer. I checked Takumi last night, and the result was clear.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Rin,,But why would you pick Takumi first? That's not fair!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"If Jonathan is the Seer, the game ends today. But if he's the wolf, he's trying to eliminate a villager.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Midori,,It's hard to tell who to believe. Takumi seems very upset.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,Because I'm innocent! Jonathan is the wolf and he's lying to get me killed!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I have no reason to lie. The truth is simple.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Rin,,I don't want to vote for Takumi... but Jonathan sounds so sure.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Takumi, your reaction is aggressive, which is normal, but Jonathan's claim is direct.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I feel bad for Takumi, but we have to trust the Seer if he's telling the truth.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,Don't listen to him! He's tricking you all!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
